# The low ledge on the south rear runway to the Hellride (F42), on the left: ollie, grind, BS 50-50.
park soma
spawn south_rear_runway_to_hellride
cmd 0 speed 4.5
hold ollie 4..14
tap grind 40
bot balance
run 360
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,slide=false} within 20..80
expect no event bail
